OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight winds reach 85mph as
OL,4,AScotland is hit by Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvernight winds reached 85mph at
OL,7,FMachrihanish in Argyll and Bute as
OL,8,FStorm Boelo took hold across Scotland.
OL,10,FTrain and ferry services have been
OL,11,Fcancelled and police have warned
OL,12,Fagainst unnecessary road journeys
OL,14,FAn amber Met Office weather warning
OL,15,Fcame into effect at 21:00 on Saturday,
OL,16,Fcovering the mainland and Western Isles
OL,17,Funtil 21:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
