OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight winds reach 85mph as
OL,4,AScotland is hit by Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes are without power,
OL,7,Fincluding in Argyll and Bute, Western
OL,8,FIsles, Orkney, Ayrshire and Dumfries
OL,9,Fand Galloway. Forecasters say the
OL,10,Fstrong winds could result in injury,
OL,11,Fflying debris, power cuts and damage to
OL,12,Ftrees and buildings.
